 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 10.59,
   "end": 12.94,
   "text": "Honey, I told you something"
  },
  {
   "start": 13.05,
   "end": 15.2,
   "text": "Sorry, I didn't hear"
  },
  {
   "start": 15.35,
   "end": 17.6,
   "text": "Maybe there was something"
  },
  {
   "start": 17.65,
   "end": 20.1,
   "text": "Yeah, yeah, yeah, stuck in your ear"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.18,
   "end": 25.5,
   "text": "Why is it every time you say you do, you don't?"
  },
  {
   "start": 26.5,
   "end": 31.8,
   "text": "Maybe I just thought that you were talking on the phone"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.0,
   "end": 36.55,
   "text": "Honey, you're looking lovely tonight"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.6,
   "end": 38.8,
   "text": "Sorry, you're wasting time"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.9,
   "end": 41.2,
   "text": "Baby, this ain't your lucky night"
  },
  {
   "start": 41.25,
   "end": 43.5,
   "text": "Well, trying ain't a crime"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.7,
   "end": 49.0,
   "text": "Why is it every time I like to do, you don't?"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.95,
   "end": 54.9,
   "text": "Maybe you could try a little romance and a comb"
  },
  {
   "start": 55.29,
   "end": 58.6,
   "text": "Let's go back in time"
  },
  {
   "start": 59.4,
   "end": 66.8,
   "text": "Way back when we were la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.06,
   "end": 72.9,
   "text": "Now it's married life, and the daily strife should be"
  },
  {
   "start": 72.94,
   "end": 82.6,
   "text": "La-la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la"
  },
  {
   "start": 87.0,
   "end": 89.4,
   "text": "Honey, you're getting older"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.5,
   "end": 91.75,
   "text": "Yeah, and you're twenty-nine"
  },
  {
   "start": 91.8,
   "end": 94.1,
   "text": "And maybe things are colder"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.15,
   "end": 96.5,
   "text": "But honey, still you're mine"
  },
  {
   "start": 97.6,
   "end": 102.0,
   "text": "Guess it's easy to forget the moment and the why"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.9,
   "end": 108.0,
   "text": "Could it be the la-la magic keeping love alive?"
  },
  {
   "start": 108.24,
   "end": 111.5,
   "text": "Let's go back in time"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.35,
   "end": 119.7,
   "text": "Way back when we were la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.75,
   "end": 125.85,
   "text": "In fact, you and I still have time to be"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.88,
   "end": 135.6,
   "text": "La-la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.82,
   "end": 162.1,
   "text": "Let's go back in time"
  },
  {
   "start": 162.94,
   "end": 170.3,
   "text": "Way back when we were la-la-la-la-la, la-la-la"
  },
  {
   "start": 170.55,
   "end": 176.45,
   "text": "Back when you and I still had time to be"
  },
